(The QuantumVault contract implements a quantum-safe time-locked savings vault using ML-DSA signatures for) Tj
T* (post-quantum authentication. It leverages QoreChain's precompiles for key status and signature verification. The) Tj
T* (contract demonstrates strong quantum readiness with proper use of ML-DSA and domain separation in signatures.) Tj
T* (However, there are medium-severity concerns regarding potential key reuse vulnerabilities and reentrancy risks in) Tj
T* (the withdrawal process. The design intentionally excludes emergency mechanisms, which is both a strength and a) Tj
T* (limitation.) Tj
